cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mapademic, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Mapademic: an interactive map of researchers placed by coauthorship"
abstract: >-
  A zoomable map of the 8.4 million researchers in OpenAlex with 15 or more
  works, placed by who they write papers with, and an in-browser search for
  the shortest chain of coauthors between any two of them.
